A minimal stateless class: no fields, no :INHERIT, one method that only
uses parameters and locals. Unqualified-field rules have nothing to say
(no field set). Should be clean.
-- input.ssl --
:CLASS TextTools;

:PROCEDURE Shout;
	:PARAMETERS sText;
	:DECLARE sOut;
	sOut := Upper(AllTrim(sText)) + "!";
	:RETURN sOut;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:CLASS TextTools;

:PROCEDURE Shout;
	:PARAMETERS sText;
	:DECLARE sOut;
	sOut := Upper(AllTrim(sText)) + "!";
	:RETURN sOut;
:ENDPROC;
